Original change's description:
> Reland "[scanner] Fix integer overflow in LiteralBuffer and guard stream limits"
>
> This is a reland of commit 4095047c346827c127d2e701cc591b5b39190a4b
>
> Changed the unittest to not expect a concrete death message, since
> official builds strip CHECK messages.
>
> Original change's description:
> > [scanner] Fix integer overflow in LiteralBuffer and guard stream limits
> >
> > Upgrade internal capacity tracking indices in LiteralBuffer from signed
> > int to size_t to securely accumulate giant identifier sequences.
> > Refactor backing store boundary evaluations to leverage .size()
> > arithmetic securely, preventing downward memory aliasing overwrites
> > triggered by integer wraps during literal conversion.
> >
> > Additionally, safeguard character streaming channels (ChunkedStream and
> > Utf8ExternalStreamingStream) with strict cumulative size threshold
> > checks (CHECK_LE) prior to fetching chunks to halt processing cleanly on
> > excessive input streams.
